      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "          Hi and welcome to my website. My real name is Laís, but I'd rather be\ncalled Lala or Lev. I'm 23 years old, I have a bunch of hobbies, but my favorite\nones are gaming, drawing and singing. I'm from Brazil. I'm very good at english\n(side eye), and I'm currently trying to learn my third language which is\nmandarin.",
      "fontSize": 31.07396820538373,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "bottom",
      "containerId": "KzNDvGKw3haxaPsFLlghs",
      "originalText": "          Hi and welcome to my website. My real name is Laís, but I'd rather be called Lala or Lev. I'm 23 years old, I have a bunch of hobbies, but my favorite ones are gaming, drawing and singing. I'm from Brazil. I'm very good at english (side eye), and I'm currently trying to learn my third language which is mandarin.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
